1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,920
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,800
Captain Di.

3
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,200
Can't you go easy on us?

4
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,120
Exactly.

5
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:25,400
We don't stand a chance.

6
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:26,680
A bet's a bet.

7
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,320
Winner gets half a day.

8
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,120
Those are the rules.

9
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:35,000
Anyone else?

10
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:41,080
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

11
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:42,440
During training,

12
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,960
no need for ceremony.

13
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:45,040
Rise.

14
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,480
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

15
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,680
A-Nian.

16
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:57,880
Just a few days,

17
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,400
and you've improved again.

18
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:01,040
You flatter me, Your Majesty.

19
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,920
It's been too long since we sparred.

20
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,120
I'm eager to spar.

21
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,760
To spar with His Majesty,

22
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,720
you'll have to get past me first.

23
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,680
Don't forget,

24
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:11,160
you still owe me drinks

25
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,080
for losing our last sword match.

26
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:14,880
Always after my meager salary.

27
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,000
Next time, I win.

28
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,440
The Divine Guard

29
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,880
was trained by Marquis Wu himself.

30
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:24,160
Now that it is in your hands,

31
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,240
I can rest easy.

32
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:28,840
A-Nian,

33
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,480
you've honored your family.

34
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,560
Father called it

35
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,480
Great Ning's sharpest spear.

36
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,840
It must never lose its edge.

37
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:41,280
One day, you'll stand on your own

38
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,760
as Marquis Wu did

39
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,120
and defend the frontier.

40
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:49,640
I remember your childhood dream:

41
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,800
to ride into battle.

42
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:55,120
Now palace walls confine you,

43
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:56,280
serving as my shield.

44
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:58,240
My father died young.

45
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,920
Your Majesty gave me

46
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,000
a place to belong.

47
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,440
Protecting you now

48
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:06,520
is my proudest battlefield.

49
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:08,920
I serve with all my heart.

50
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:14,280
With you and Di Nian beside me,

51
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,400
you are my strongest allies.

52
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,280
The capital's safety and my own

53
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,840
rest on both your shoulders.

54
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,200
A-Nian,

55
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:27,200
I have another task for you.

56
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,600
Choose 12 cavalrymen.

57
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,840
Train them in secret.

58
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,760
You mean…

59
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,480
You'll know when the time comes.

60
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,880
As you command.

61
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,840
The tribute scholars enter.

62
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,040
Greetings, Your Majesty.

63
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:18,560
May Your Majesty be blessed.

64
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:46,200
I bought donkey-hide gelatin.

65
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,480
Everyone, try some.

66
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:50,320
-Here.
-I'll take one too.

67
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:51,920
-Thank you.
-Thanks.

68
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,080
Here.

69
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:59,360
Mengmeng…

70
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:01,080
The results come out today.

71
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:02,760
Don't worry.

72
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:05,160
We'll both pass. Don't be nervous.

73
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,400
Fu Zhi, I'm not nervous.

74
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,640
But stop pinching me.

75
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,920
-Here!
-Here!

76
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,040
Good news!

77
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,680
Where is An Qing of the capital?

78
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:27,280
Here!

79
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,320
Congratulations, Scholar An.

80
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:30,840
16th in the second class.

81
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:34,080
I passed…

82
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:38,600
Where is Zuo Qiurong of Jingzhou?

83
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,720
Here!

84
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:44,320
You ranked 13th in the third class.

85
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:47,480
I passed too!

86
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,960
I passed!

87
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:52,320
Where is Lu Xiaowan of Qingzhou?

88
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:54,480
Here!

89
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,880
16th in the third class.

90
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,320
I passed! I passed too!

91
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,280
Fu Zhi,

92
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,880
why no name yet?

93
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:10,960
Did something go wrong?

94
00:07:14,320 --> 00:07:15,160
Fu Zhi,

95
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:20,120
I drew close to His Majesty

96
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:22,560
and overheard state affairs.

97
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:23,600
He found out.

98
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,160
Perhaps I angered him.

99
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:29,720
His Majesty's moods are unpredictable.

100
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:32,080
Could he mean to punish you?

101
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,000
He's the Son of Heaven.

102
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,680
Surely he isn't that petty.

103
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:49,520
Meng Tinghui of Shazhou,
hear the decree.

104
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,200
Read it.

105
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:04,560
After reviewing the palace exam,

106
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:05,960
the worthy were selected.

107
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,080
In the special exam,

108
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:09,240
Meng Tinghui of Shazhou
Women's Academy

109
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,440
has ranked first

110
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:11,600
and is Top Scholar.

111
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:14,360
Let it be proclaimed throughout the realm.

112
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:02,360
Fu Zhi,

113
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:05,480
it's me.

114
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:10,920
It really is me.

115
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:15,200
I'm the Top Scholar!

116
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,800
The Top Scholar!

117
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,800
You hesitate over every move.

118
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,800
Something is troubling you.

119
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:17,760
Chancellor.

120
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,680
His Majesty has proclaimed

121
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:22,640
that Meng Tinghui is the first woman

122
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,720
to take first place in all three exams.

123
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,600
With such favor,

124
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,440
her future may be…

125
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:32,320
limitless.

126
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:34,280
The new Top Scholar?

127
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,760
An empty title.

128
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:39,680
Since she has no actual post,

129
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:43,800
send her home to await appointment.

130
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:47,760
A masterful move, Chancellor.

131
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:49,800
You truly put the realm first.

132
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:52,200
I am in awe.

133
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:05,640
Great Ning's first-year special exam.

134
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:12,720
Top Scholar Meng Tinghui of Shazhou!

135
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:20,640
Congratulations!

136
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:21,560
Congratulations!

137
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,600
Great Ning's first-year special exam.

138
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:32,880
Top Scholar Meng Tinghui of Shazhou!

139
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,080
Make way!

140
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:48,760
Meng Tinghui really came first.

141
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,800
First in all three.

142
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:50,800
Remarkable!

143
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:52,960
The God of Literature stayed here!

144
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:54,880
Boss, we must pay our respects.

145
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:56,200
Of course.

146
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,440
I'll take you there.

147
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:59,000
-Great!
-She stayed here!

148
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:01,280
It's true!

149
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:05,200
-Official Meng!
-Top Scholar Meng!

150
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:06,840
Come to Spring House!

151
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:14,000
Mengmeng!

152
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,880
Mengmeng!

153
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,400
Mengmeng is here!

154
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,760
Look! Over here!

155
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:19,920
Look this way!

156
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:22,160
A brilliant mind!

157
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,880
We have everything you need!

158
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:25,280
She's my dear friend!

159
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:27,160
We came here together!

160
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,720
Mengmeng, look!

161
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:30,880
Congratulations, Top Scholar Meng!

162
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:31,960
Look!

163
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,160
Top Scholar Meng!

164
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,160
Top Scholar Meng!

165
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,560
Top Scholar Meng!

166
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:08,560
Congratulations!

167
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:10,200
Top Scholar Meng!

168
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:13,400
See that?

169
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:15,160
We're very close.

170
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,560
Top Scholar Meng!

171
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:21,200
Congratulations!

172
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,880
Look at this location.

173
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,440
In the entire capital,

174
00:13:48,520 --> 00:13:50,840
Changle Street is the most prosperous.

175
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:51,760
Just look.

176
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:52,960
This storefront

177
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:56,240
faces the famous Brocade House.

178
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:59,000
Next door is the old Rouge Pavilion.

179
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,320
Spring House is across the street.

180
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:03,880
If not for family troubles,

181
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:05,360
he'd never sublet

182
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:07,760
such an excellent shop.

183
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:11,960
Perfect.

184
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:14,000
It's spacious and impressive.

185
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:16,480
A little work, and we can open at once.

186
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:18,480
With authentic lamb noodles,

187
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:20,360
I'll outdo Spring House in no time.

188
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:23,040
I love it. I'll take it.

189
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:26,040
You're certainly decisive, Shopkeeper Yan.

190
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:27,880
Pay the deposit today,

191
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:29,240
then see the Commissioner

192
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:30,520
for your license.

193
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:32,000
The Market Commissioner?

194
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,560
What does he do?

195
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:36,120
The Market Commissioner

196
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:38,680
regulates every business in the capital.

197
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:40,680
That includes food inspections,

198
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:41,600
shop safety,

199
00:14:41,680 --> 00:14:43,520
and tax collection.

200
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,720
Speak of the devil.

201
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:47,480
Our Market Commissioner

202
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:48,840
is Young Lord Shen.

203
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:50,920
Who did you say it was?

204
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:52,600
Who in the capital

205
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:54,640
hasn't heard of Shen Zhishu,

206
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:56,440
the famous Young Lord Shen?

207
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:57,640
To open a restaurant,

208
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,200
you must see him later

209
00:14:59,280 --> 00:15:00,760
to obtain your license.

210
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,160
With luck,

211
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:04,080
you can open in three months.

212
00:15:04,160 --> 00:15:05,840
Why so long?

213
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:08,840
The capital has stricter rules.

214
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:09,760
The capital

215
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,840
has no shortage of merchants.

216
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:13,720
Licenses are limited.

217
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:16,480
Without a local official's endorsement,

218
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:18,280
waiting a year or more

219
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:19,640
is perfectly normal.

220
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:23,680
I shouldn't have thrown him out.

221
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:26,120
We can discuss it later.

222
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:28,240
Young Lord Shen!

223
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,120
Over here!

224
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:35,280
Pretending not to know me?

225
00:15:39,160 --> 00:15:40,000
Master Shen.

226
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,320
Forgive me.

227
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,480
Shopkeeper Yu and I reserved this table.

228
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:46,600
I thought you'd left.

229
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,120
We came especially for you.

230
00:15:58,600 --> 00:15:59,440
Master Shen,

231
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:03,600
come sit with us.

232
00:16:03,680 --> 00:16:05,080
We booked this place today.

233
00:16:05,160 --> 00:16:06,680
So I'm afraid you'll have

234
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:09,000
to keep us company.

235
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:11,800
We even prepared

236
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:13,640
a fine aged wine for you:

237
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:15,200
Spring Breeze Wine.

238
00:16:16,040 --> 00:16:17,520
Allow me to pour.

239
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:19,000
Have a taste.

240
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:21,240
Thank you.

241
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:23,440
Try it, Young Master Shen.

242
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:26,680
How is it?

243
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:30,640
Let me refill your cup.

244
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:38,960
It's been so long, Young Lord Shen.

245
00:16:39,040 --> 00:16:40,640
You've gotten much thinner.

246
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:43,920
He was thinner as a child.

247
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:45,120
When we were young,

248
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:47,080
Father tried to arrange our marriage.

249
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:48,640
I stubbornly refused,

250
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:50,040
so he gave up.

251
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,560
Thinking back,

252
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:53,320
I truly regret it.

253
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:00,800
Speaking of childhood,

254
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:01,800
during Shangsi,

255
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:03,840
Young Lord Shen chased off wasps for me

256
00:17:03,920 --> 00:17:04,760
but ended up

257
00:17:04,840 --> 00:17:06,360
swollen like a pufferfish.

258
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,000
That's nothing.

259
00:17:08,080 --> 00:17:10,360
He once caught minnows for me,

260
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:11,720
fell into the river,

261
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:13,200
and came out a drowned rat.

262
00:17:17,360 --> 00:17:19,200
Why dredge up ancient history?

263
00:17:19,280 --> 00:17:21,280
I have business today. Excuse me.

264
00:17:22,360 --> 00:17:23,920
-Sit. Stay.
-Sit. Stay.

265
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:32,360
My dear Shen,

266
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:34,360
in Shazhou, we met beneath the flowers

267
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:35,480
and swore our love.

268
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:36,560
Now, in the capital,

269
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:37,720
you've forgotten me?

270
00:17:38,520 --> 00:17:40,640
So you found two new sweethearts.

271
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:42,800
-Who is she?
-Who?

272
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:45,120
I'm the woman he cherishes

273
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:46,960
and will marry with full ceremony.

274
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:48,240
Who do you think I am?

275
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:02,200
My apologies.

276
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:03,440
My wife has a temper.

277
00:18:03,520 --> 00:18:04,560
Please excuse her.

278
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:07,000
-Your wife?
-Your wife?

279
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:16,880
Shameless!

280
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:18,440
Scoundrel!

281
00:18:18,520 --> 00:18:19,880
You…

282
00:18:22,800 --> 00:18:23,640
I spoiled you.

283
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:28,800
Shopkeeper Yan,

284
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:30,480
I know you rescued me,

285
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:32,600
but could you choose a better method?

286
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:35,360
How will you thank your savior?

287
00:18:38,040 --> 00:18:39,280
In stories, a life debt

288
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:41,400
is repaid with marriage.

289
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,480
But let's spare ourselves.

290
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:45,200
I'm still shaken by the thought.

291
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:47,760
Just tell me what you want.

292
00:18:48,480 --> 00:18:50,200
Fine. I'll be direct.

293
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:52,000
I'll open Bofeng House

294
00:18:52,080 --> 00:18:53,080
here in the capital

295
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:54,640
for authentic Shazhou food.

296
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:56,440
I've chosen the shop next door.

297
00:18:57,040 --> 00:18:59,480
But I hear

298
00:18:59,560 --> 00:19:00,920
a new business license

299
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,760
can take over a year.

300
00:19:02,840 --> 00:19:05,120
So I hoped Young Lord Shen

301
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:06,040
might endorse me

302
00:19:06,120 --> 00:19:06,960
and expedite it.

303
00:19:09,280 --> 00:19:10,800
I knew you had an angle.

304
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,680
Apply through the proper channels.

305
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:13,600
If approved,

306
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:14,920
you'll be notified.

307
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,800
You have to promise me.

308
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,360
And if I don't?

309
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:19,680
You…

310
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:22,120
If you refuse,

311
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:24,240
I won't speak to you again.

312
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:28,000
What an unusual way to ask a favor.

313
00:19:28,080 --> 00:19:29,040
But I, Shen Zhishu,

314
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:30,360
won't fall for it.

315
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:32,760
Farewell.

316
00:19:34,760 --> 00:19:35,920
Ten jars of Shaosanbai.

317
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:40,080
What? I didn't hear you.

318
00:19:42,760 --> 00:19:45,760
Plus Shazhou's finest grape wine.

319
00:19:45,840 --> 00:19:48,280
Don't push your luck.

320
00:19:52,760 --> 00:19:54,720
I need proof you're sincere.

321
00:19:54,800 --> 00:19:56,400
How about you also cook

322
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:57,680
a Shazhou feast?

323
00:19:58,280 --> 00:19:59,560
In your dreams.

324
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:04,560
Then I'll drink elsewhere.

325
00:20:08,280 --> 00:20:09,120
Stop.

326
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:19,200
Ten jars of Shaosanbai,

327
00:20:19,280 --> 00:20:21,200
five jars of premium Shazhou wine,

328
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:22,840
and a meal cooked by me.

329
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:24,800
Take it or leave it.

330
00:20:26,360 --> 00:20:27,600
You should've said so.

331
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:29,800
Shopkeeper Yan,

332
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:31,040
next time you want me,

333
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:32,320
just send an invitation.

334
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:33,680
No need to go

335
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:35,120
so far out of your way.

336
00:20:35,200 --> 00:20:36,600
You…

337
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:38,640
Mind your manners.

338
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:40,600
This is the capital.

339
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:47,920
Get lost! Who wants to see you?

340
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:50,000
What was that?

341
00:20:50,080 --> 00:20:51,320
I said…

342
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:53,960
Get lost! Who wants to see you?

343
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:41,040
Thank you.

344
00:21:43,800 --> 00:21:44,640
Uncle Gu.

345
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:46,040
It's been a long time.

346
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:47,760
Zhili.

347
00:21:47,840 --> 00:21:49,600
Our parents prepared a banquet

348
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:51,840
to celebrate your Hanlin appointment.

349
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:52,800
Why so late?

350
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:56,720
Don't trouble yourself, Uncle Gu.

351
00:21:56,800 --> 00:21:57,880
I'll take Zhili home.

352
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:03,960
Leyan, keep a scholar's heart.

353
00:22:04,040 --> 00:22:05,320
A future vast as the sea.

354
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:06,800
Your Hanlin post is set.

355
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:08,800
Remember, its honored halls

356
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:10,080
will test your mettle.

357
00:22:10,760 --> 00:22:11,600
Here.

358
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:13,720
Thank you, Teacher.

359
00:22:15,160 --> 00:22:16,880
Head home too, Uncle Gu.

360
00:22:17,480 --> 00:22:19,120
Don't make Aunt worry.

361
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:20,080
When you're free,

362
00:22:20,160 --> 00:22:21,680
bring her to visit us.

363
00:22:24,120 --> 00:22:26,000
Go on. Your parents are waiting.

364
00:22:26,080 --> 00:22:27,240
Uncle Gu is right.

365
00:22:27,800 --> 00:22:29,600
Don't keep them waiting.

366
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:30,920
Let's go, Zhili.

367
00:22:36,160 --> 00:22:37,640
What did you just call me?

368
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:38,640
Show some respect.

369
00:22:38,720 --> 00:22:39,800
Call me Sister.

370
00:22:40,320 --> 00:22:41,280
Sister Zhili.

371
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:44,400
Our parents made a feast today.

372
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:46,040
The exam made you thinner.

373
00:22:46,120 --> 00:22:47,880
Make sure you eat plenty.

374
00:22:51,520 --> 00:22:52,640
The last dish:

375
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:55,280
Mother's favorite sweet-and-sour ribs.

376
00:22:55,360 --> 00:22:56,600
Let me taste one first.

377
00:22:56,680 --> 00:22:57,840
Sit down and eat.

378
00:22:57,920 --> 00:22:59,280
Thanks for cooking, Father.

379
00:22:59,360 --> 00:23:01,240
Mother, we owe this feast to you.

380
00:23:01,320 --> 00:23:03,080
I've missed Father's cooking.

381
00:23:03,160 --> 00:23:04,880
My handsome jawline

382
00:23:04,960 --> 00:23:07,440
-gets sharper every day.
-When the tiger's away,

383
00:23:07,520 --> 00:23:08,720
the monkey rules.

384
00:23:09,840 --> 00:23:12,200
You seem to be living quite well.

385
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:14,800
His Majesty made you Commissioner,

386
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:16,520
so you chase poetry all day.

387
00:23:16,600 --> 00:23:17,560
This position—

388
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:20,240
did you beg His Majesty for it?

389
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:23,080
Mother, listen to Father.

390
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:25,800
I do serious work.

391
00:23:25,880 --> 00:23:27,000
He assigns my work.

392
00:23:27,080 --> 00:23:28,280
Is that up to me?

393
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:31,720
Yesterday, you called him frivolous.

394
00:23:31,800 --> 00:23:34,560
Today, you accuse him
of flattering the Emperor.

395
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:35,680
What?

396
00:23:35,760 --> 00:23:37,000
Must your son scowl

397
00:23:37,080 --> 00:23:38,800
like some stern moralist

398
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:40,000
all day long

399
00:23:40,080 --> 00:23:41,160
to please you?

400
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,600
Thank you, Mother.

401
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:47,880
His Majesty gave him this office.

402
00:23:47,960 --> 00:23:49,640
Countless eyes are watching.

403
00:23:49,720 --> 00:23:51,240
One misstep

404
00:23:51,320 --> 00:23:53,440
will give his enemies ammunition.

405
00:23:54,360 --> 00:23:56,320
He may seem careless,

406
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:58,200
but he takes real work seriously.

407
00:23:58,920 --> 00:24:00,240
His Majesty values him

408
00:24:00,320 --> 00:24:01,760
and gives him vital work.

409
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:03,600
My dear sister.

410
00:24:03,680 --> 00:24:05,440
All my kindness has paid off.

411
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:07,840
Thank you, Father.

412
00:24:09,080 --> 00:24:09,920
Father,

413
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:11,440
as Market Commissioner,

414
00:24:11,520 --> 00:24:13,080
I'm the only man at court

415
00:24:13,160 --> 00:24:14,560
who can do this job.

416
00:24:15,200 --> 00:24:16,440
I may seem

417
00:24:16,520 --> 00:24:17,560
to live indulgently,

418
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:19,600
but there's real skill behind it.

419
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:20,520
Arrogant.

420
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:24,440
Others climb to high office.

421
00:24:24,520 --> 00:24:26,280
Yours only grows narrower.

422
00:24:26,360 --> 00:24:27,800
You were a court counselor.

423
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:29,040
And now?

424
00:24:29,120 --> 00:24:31,640
You need permission
even to attend court.

425
00:24:32,280 --> 00:24:33,720
Look at A-Nian.

426
00:24:33,800 --> 00:24:35,360
He's always had more sense.

427
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:37,600
He never makes us worry

428
00:24:37,680 --> 00:24:39,200
and always thinks of us.

429
00:24:40,800 --> 00:24:41,640
Thanks, Father.

430
00:24:42,320 --> 00:24:44,160
-Sister.
-A-Nian, give it to me.

431
00:24:44,840 --> 00:24:47,360
You're idle and ostentatious.

432
00:24:47,440 --> 00:24:49,040
It'll cost you someday.

433
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:51,240
Here, Father.

434
00:24:51,320 --> 00:24:52,760
Try this too.

435
00:24:55,320 --> 00:24:56,160
Mother.

436
00:24:57,720 --> 00:24:58,600
Look at yourself.

437
00:24:58,680 --> 00:25:00,320
You look nothing like me.

438
00:25:01,920 --> 00:25:03,040
Nor your mother.

439
00:25:04,080 --> 00:25:05,080
Look at A-Nian.

440
00:25:06,040 --> 00:25:07,200
My eyes, nose, mouth—

441
00:25:07,280 --> 00:25:08,440
which part isn't yours?

442
00:25:08,520 --> 00:25:09,800
A-Nian…

443
00:25:09,880 --> 00:25:11,640
One might think A-Nian's your son.

444
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:12,600
If only.

445
00:25:12,680 --> 00:25:15,400
I'd gladly have A-Nian as my son.

446
00:25:16,520 --> 00:25:18,160
The Di clan died for the realm.

447
00:25:18,240 --> 00:25:19,160
At 18, A-Nian

448
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:20,920
patrolled the frontier. And you?

449
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:22,560
You take His Majesty

450
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:23,600
hawking daily.

451
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:24,920
You don't act like one.

452
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:27,000
Visit the palace less.

453
00:25:27,080 --> 00:25:29,040
His Majesty should be surrounded

454
00:25:29,120 --> 00:25:30,840
by upright men like A-Nian.

455
00:25:30,920 --> 00:25:33,040
-I do it for him.
-Enough, Brother.

456
00:25:33,120 --> 00:25:34,520
Let it go.

457
00:25:37,440 --> 00:25:38,840
He can't do without me.

458
00:25:39,560 --> 00:25:40,600
If I stayed away,

459
00:25:40,680 --> 00:25:41,520
in three days,

460
00:25:41,600 --> 00:25:42,800
he'd seek me out.

461
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:46,120
Listen to this nonsense!

462
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:48,080
Can he not govern without you?

463
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:50,680
Eat, A-Nian.

464
00:25:50,760 --> 00:25:53,680
You're the oldest of the three,

465
00:25:53,760 --> 00:25:55,960
yet you cause the most worry.

466
00:25:56,040 --> 00:25:58,000
Anyone would think you're the youngest.

467
00:25:58,080 --> 00:25:59,520
I'm just good-looking.

468
00:26:03,840 --> 00:26:05,320
Because you have no brains.

469
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:07,520
Father, Mother,

470
00:26:07,600 --> 00:26:08,720
aren't we celebrating

471
00:26:08,800 --> 00:26:10,320
Sister placing second

472
00:26:10,880 --> 00:26:12,080
and finally joining

473
00:26:12,160 --> 00:26:13,720
the Hanlin Academy?

474
00:26:13,800 --> 00:26:15,320
I brought her a gift.

475
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:17,600
Look at us, forgetting the occasion.

476
00:26:17,680 --> 00:26:19,520
Li'er, we have a gift for you too.

477
00:26:27,280 --> 00:26:28,240
Thank you, A-Nian.

478
00:26:28,800 --> 00:26:30,240
My gloves just wore through.

479
00:26:30,960 --> 00:26:32,200
A-Nian's so thoughtful.

480
00:26:33,280 --> 00:26:34,760
Li'er, look at this.

481
00:26:36,320 --> 00:26:37,720
The Four Treasures

482
00:26:37,800 --> 00:26:40,200
were made by your father himself.

483
00:26:40,280 --> 00:26:41,640
This inkstone was carved

484
00:26:41,720 --> 00:26:43,200
from Lanshan stone

485
00:26:43,280 --> 00:26:46,200
the late Emperor gave me
for topping all three.

486
00:26:46,280 --> 00:26:47,200
Warm in winter,

487
00:26:47,280 --> 00:26:49,400
cool in summer, and keeps ink fresh.

488
00:26:49,480 --> 00:26:51,080
Thank you, Father and Mother.

489
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:52,360
When I entered office,

490
00:26:52,440 --> 00:26:53,960
why did no one give me a gift?

491
00:26:54,040 --> 00:26:55,480
What gift did you merit?

492
00:26:55,560 --> 00:26:57,320
Nanmu gambling chips

493
00:26:57,400 --> 00:26:58,680
or jade dice?

494
00:27:00,240 --> 00:27:02,960
Or buy back
more courtesans for you?

495
00:27:04,840 --> 00:27:05,680
Father.

496
00:27:05,760 --> 00:27:07,880
Am I really your son?

497
00:27:07,960 --> 00:27:09,200
Why always pick on me?

498
00:27:09,280 --> 00:27:10,400
If you truly think

499
00:27:10,480 --> 00:27:11,800
I disgrace the Shen name,

500
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:12,720
I'll leave now.

501
00:27:15,400 --> 00:27:16,320
Brother.

502
00:27:17,680 --> 00:27:19,000
It's fine. I'm full.

503
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:26,440
Shen Wuchen.

504
00:27:26,520 --> 00:27:27,880
Must you break his heart

505
00:27:27,960 --> 00:27:29,040
before you're happy?

506
00:27:29,120 --> 00:27:30,840
You care deeply,

507
00:27:30,920 --> 00:27:33,280
yet every word cuts him.

508
00:27:33,360 --> 00:27:34,480
Zhishu has done

509
00:27:34,560 --> 00:27:36,040
very well all these years.

510
00:27:38,400 --> 00:27:39,760
Because His Majesty

511
00:27:39,840 --> 00:27:41,960
treats him as his closest friend

512
00:27:42,040 --> 00:27:43,320
and relies on him,

513
00:27:44,040 --> 00:27:46,840
the court allows him no mistakes.

514
00:27:48,360 --> 00:27:49,880
The censors' brushes

515
00:27:50,720 --> 00:27:52,680
are sharper than swords.

516
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:58,080
So as his father,

517
00:27:59,440 --> 00:28:01,360
you turn the blade on him first?

518
00:28:03,760 --> 00:28:05,080
Look.

519
00:28:05,160 --> 00:28:06,360
You made

520
00:28:06,440 --> 00:28:07,680
his favorite soup.

521
00:28:08,360 --> 00:28:09,400
He didn't touch it.

522
00:28:33,800 --> 00:28:35,840
The appointment hasn't arrived.

523
00:28:37,640 --> 00:28:39,480
How much longer must we wait?

524
00:28:40,600 --> 00:28:41,440
Mengmeng.

525
00:28:41,520 --> 00:28:43,160
Maybe our posts are so important

526
00:28:43,240 --> 00:28:45,640
those old scholars need extra time.

527
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,280
Top Scholar.

528
00:28:47,360 --> 00:28:48,520
The Ministry sent word.

529
00:28:48,600 --> 00:28:49,600
It's here!

530
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:53,720
Thank you.

531
00:28:55,280 --> 00:28:56,280
Quick.

532
00:28:57,280 --> 00:28:58,560
Which cushy post?

533
00:29:08,280 --> 00:29:09,480
Home to await a post?

534
00:29:09,560 --> 00:29:11,280
That's impossible.

535
00:29:11,360 --> 00:29:13,000
I asked around today.

536
00:29:13,080 --> 00:29:15,200
Every other woman from our class

537
00:29:15,280 --> 00:29:16,240
already has a post.

538
00:29:16,320 --> 00:29:17,800
Shen Zhili

539
00:29:17,880 --> 00:29:19,040
and Zuo Qiurong

540
00:29:19,120 --> 00:29:21,080
both joined the Hanlin Academy.

541
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:22,520
Everyone received a post.

542
00:29:23,600 --> 00:29:25,200
Only I was ordered home to wait.

543
00:29:26,520 --> 00:29:29,000
Someone is determined
to end my career.

544
00:29:30,560 --> 00:29:31,560
Mengmeng,

545
00:29:31,640 --> 00:29:33,440
His Majesty named you Top Scholar.

546
00:29:33,520 --> 00:29:34,480
Who would dare

547
00:29:34,560 --> 00:29:35,640
block your posting?

548
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:37,360
Who else

549
00:29:39,040 --> 00:29:39,880
but Xu Ting?

550
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:42,880
Fu Zhi,

551
00:29:44,040 --> 00:29:45,240
I can't just sit here.

552
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:47,400
Before dawn, I must

553
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:48,480
find a way to court.

554
00:29:49,120 --> 00:29:50,440
We'll find a way together.

555
00:29:51,160 --> 00:29:52,800
My money, your brains.

556
00:29:52,880 --> 00:29:54,480
Nothing can stop us.

557
00:29:57,680 --> 00:29:59,080
Top Scholar Meng.

558
00:29:59,200 --> 00:30:00,600
Chancellor Xu summons you.

559
00:30:02,080 --> 00:30:02,920
Mengmeng,

560
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:04,600
summoning you at this hour

561
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:06,160
can't mean anything good.

562
00:30:06,240 --> 00:30:07,640
He may silence you for good.

563
00:30:07,720 --> 00:30:09,360
His men surround the house.

564
00:30:10,600 --> 00:30:12,200
There's no way out now.

565
00:30:13,360 --> 00:30:14,960
I have no choice.

566
00:30:15,040 --> 00:30:15,960
I must go.

567
00:30:26,280 --> 00:30:27,920
Come, my ministers.

568
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:29,680
Drink another cup with me.

569
00:30:30,240 --> 00:30:32,000
Thank you, Your Majesty.

570
00:30:36,200 --> 00:30:38,760
Top Scholar Meng Tinghui has arrived.

571
00:30:58,640 --> 00:31:01,440
Meng Tinghui,
Top Scholar of the special exam,

572
00:31:01,520 --> 00:31:03,080
greets Your Majesty.

573
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:04,920
May Your Majesty be blessed.

574
00:31:17,080 --> 00:31:19,400
Tonight, I used Xu Ting's name

575
00:31:19,480 --> 00:31:20,360
to summon you

576
00:31:20,440 --> 00:31:22,880
and test your courage.

577
00:31:22,960 --> 00:31:24,640
You dared come alone.

578
00:31:24,720 --> 00:31:25,920
Excellent.

579
00:31:27,040 --> 00:31:28,240
You have courage.

580
00:31:29,000 --> 00:31:30,520
Give Top Scholar Meng a seat.

581
00:31:34,440 --> 00:31:35,720
Thank you, Your Majesty.

582
00:31:39,720 --> 00:31:40,640
Meng Tinghui.

583
00:31:41,520 --> 00:31:43,080
You topped all three exams.

584
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:45,800
You've made me proud.

585
00:31:47,440 --> 00:31:49,520
I am truly delighted.

586
00:31:49,600 --> 00:31:51,400
With Your Majesty's protection,

587
00:31:51,960 --> 00:31:53,040
I had this chance.

588
00:31:53,120 --> 00:31:55,080
I will not fail your trust

589
00:31:55,160 --> 00:31:56,240
and serve you well.

590
00:31:56,320 --> 00:31:57,800
My ministers,

591
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:01,800
let us toast Top Scholar Meng.

592
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:03,760
To Top Scholar Meng.

593
00:32:06,280 --> 00:32:08,120
I am in high spirits tonight.

594
00:32:08,200 --> 00:32:10,440
I have another great matter to announce.

595
00:32:10,520 --> 00:32:12,560
The Left Chancellor has arrived.

596
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:29,280
Your Majesty.

597
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:31,560
You used my name

598
00:32:31,640 --> 00:32:33,120
to summon Meng Tinghui,

599
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:36,680
yet gave me no warning.

600
00:32:38,960 --> 00:32:41,400
And Your Majesty has been drinking.

601
00:32:45,840 --> 00:32:47,560
Left Chancellor, you're here.

602
00:32:47,640 --> 00:32:49,960
The women's exam ended today.

603
00:32:50,040 --> 00:32:50,880
I am pleased,

604
00:32:50,960 --> 00:32:53,360
so I invited my ministers to drink.

605
00:32:53,440 --> 00:32:54,280
Left Chancellor,

606
00:32:55,120 --> 00:32:56,520
-Have a cup.
-Your Majesty.

607
00:32:56,600 --> 00:32:58,200
I have served three reigns

608
00:32:58,760 --> 00:33:00,360
and never seen an emperor

609
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:02,840
behave so improperly before his court.

610
00:33:04,480 --> 00:33:05,520
Meng Tinghui.

611
00:33:05,600 --> 00:33:08,400
Didn't the Ministry's order reach you?

612
00:33:08,480 --> 00:33:11,760
This banquet is for sixth-rank officials.

613
00:33:11,840 --> 00:33:13,680
What right have you to sit here?

614
00:33:13,760 --> 00:33:16,520
You personally concern yourself

615
00:33:16,600 --> 00:33:18,040
with someone as lowly as me.

616
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:20,240
Then that Ministry order

617
00:33:20,320 --> 00:33:22,520
sending me home to await appointment

618
00:33:22,600 --> 00:33:24,800
truly came from you.

619
00:33:24,880 --> 00:33:25,720
Wait.

620
00:33:27,600 --> 00:33:28,760
Sent home to wait?

621
00:33:28,840 --> 00:33:32,080
I personally selected a woman
who topped all three exams

622
00:33:32,160 --> 00:33:33,640
for an important post.

623
00:33:33,720 --> 00:33:36,520
How did she become an idle scholar
with nowhere to go?

624
00:33:36,600 --> 00:33:37,920
Left Chancellor,

625
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:39,160
what does this mean?

626
00:33:39,880 --> 00:33:41,160
Your Majesty,

627
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:44,040
The Six Ministries

628
00:33:44,120 --> 00:33:45,040
have no vacancies.

629
00:33:45,120 --> 00:33:47,000
A hasty placement

630
00:33:47,080 --> 00:33:49,040
would waste her talents.

631
00:33:49,120 --> 00:33:51,280
Huo An.

632
00:33:51,360 --> 00:33:52,720
Escort her back to Shazhou

633
00:33:52,800 --> 00:33:54,760
to await appointment.

634
00:33:54,840 --> 00:33:56,880
If no Ministry can place her,

635
00:33:56,960 --> 00:33:58,680
send her to the Bureau.

636
00:34:01,600 --> 00:34:03,400
Shazhou's Black Tiger Hall,

637
00:34:03,480 --> 00:34:04,840
the Tiger Roar Gang here,

638
00:34:04,920 --> 00:34:06,480
Ding Chong, their accomplice,

639
00:34:06,560 --> 00:34:09,160
and Dong Shoucai,
who deceived his superiors—

640
00:34:09,240 --> 00:34:10,200
how many more

641
00:34:10,280 --> 00:34:11,640
villains plague this realm?

642
00:34:12,800 --> 00:34:13,960
All of you

643
00:34:14,640 --> 00:34:16,120
turn a blind eye,

644
00:34:16,200 --> 00:34:17,680
play deaf and dumb,

645
00:34:17,760 --> 00:34:19,160
and pretend all is well.

646
00:34:19,240 --> 00:34:21,920
Then I will establish
the Bureau of Intelligence

647
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:24,520
to right the realm's injustices.

648
00:34:24,600 --> 00:34:25,680
Do you think

649
00:34:25,760 --> 00:34:27,920
we are all incompetent?

650
00:34:28,000 --> 00:34:29,120
Must you create one

651
00:34:29,200 --> 00:34:32,040
and entrust it to an untested novice?

652
00:34:32,120 --> 00:34:33,800
Then answer me this.

653
00:34:34,920 --> 00:34:36,240
Why are you so desperate

654
00:34:36,320 --> 00:34:38,680
to drive my chosen talent
out of the capital?

655
00:34:38,760 --> 00:34:41,200
What exactly do you intend?

656
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:44,200
Your Majesty,

657
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:46,680
A new agency is a grave matter.

658
00:34:46,760 --> 00:34:47,960
A hasty decision

659
00:34:48,040 --> 00:34:49,800
could throw the court into turmoil.

660
00:34:49,880 --> 00:34:51,440
My decision is final.

661
00:34:52,200 --> 00:34:53,520
From this day forward,

662
00:34:54,840 --> 00:34:57,560
Meng Tinghui will direct
the Bureau of Intelligence,

663
00:34:57,640 --> 00:34:59,960
outside the Chancellors
and Six Ministries,

664
00:35:00,040 --> 00:35:01,800
and report directly to me.

665
00:35:10,360 --> 00:35:11,240
I accept.

666
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:12,920
Thank you for your great favor.

667
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:14,200
For her training,

668
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:17,000
some new blood will make it livelier.

669
00:35:17,480 --> 00:35:19,760
Shen Zhili placed second.

670
00:35:19,840 --> 00:35:21,000
Why keep her in Hanlin

671
00:35:21,080 --> 00:35:22,880
staring at dusty papers?

672
00:35:22,960 --> 00:35:24,280
Effective immediately,

673
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:26,600
she joins the Bureau

674
00:35:26,680 --> 00:35:29,120
to assist Meng Tinghui.

675
00:35:30,680 --> 00:35:31,520
I accept.

676
00:35:31,600 --> 00:35:32,440
Your Majesty.

677
00:35:33,200 --> 00:35:36,400
You'd entrust vital affairs
to two mere girls?

678
00:35:36,480 --> 00:35:39,080
This will upend the order of the court!

679
00:35:39,160 --> 00:35:44,320
I beg Your Majesty
to revoke the decree.

680
00:35:46,200 --> 00:35:47,680
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

681
00:35:52,240 --> 00:35:54,760
Your dragon-headed rosewood staff

682
00:35:55,560 --> 00:35:57,520
may overrule the Six Ministries,

683
00:35:57,600 --> 00:36:00,520
but would it overrule my imperial seal?

684
00:36:00,600 --> 00:36:02,280
You hide behind your age

685
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:04,000
and repeatedly

686
00:36:04,080 --> 00:36:05,840
defy my will. Do you truly think

687
00:36:07,640 --> 00:36:09,680
I can do nothing to you?

688
00:36:11,080 --> 00:36:12,000
Your Majesty.

689
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:16,160
Do you know what you're doing?

690
00:36:24,080 --> 00:36:27,880
I was only joking
with the Left Chancellor.

691
00:36:29,760 --> 00:36:30,720
Left Chancellor.

692
00:36:32,160 --> 00:36:33,440
Did you truly think

693
00:36:33,520 --> 00:36:34,960
I would harm him?

694
00:36:35,040 --> 00:36:38,440
The Left Chancellor is

695
00:36:38,520 --> 00:36:40,320
a pillar of Great Ning.

696
00:36:41,560 --> 00:36:42,400
Come.

697
00:36:43,280 --> 00:36:46,160
Everyone, drink to the Left Chancellor.

698
00:36:46,680 --> 00:36:49,240
-Your Majesty, you're drunk.
-Your Majesty.

699
00:36:49,760 --> 00:36:51,440
Careful, Your Majesty.

700
00:36:51,520 --> 00:36:52,520
Your Majesty.

701
00:36:53,160 --> 00:36:54,800
Drink to him for me.

702
00:36:57,560 --> 00:36:59,280
His Majesty never drinks.

703
00:36:59,880 --> 00:37:01,400
Why so drunk tonight?

704
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:04,400
A Top Scholar entering the palace?

705
00:37:08,520 --> 00:37:11,040
More like Daji entering the palace.

706
00:37:25,800 --> 00:37:27,640
Careful, Your Majesty.

707
00:37:41,600 --> 00:37:42,760
Your Majesty.

708
00:37:42,840 --> 00:37:44,080
It's so late.

709
00:37:44,160 --> 00:37:45,680
Will Official Meng come?

710
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:07,360
Guard Huang.

711
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:08,520
Has he retired?

712
00:38:16,240 --> 00:38:17,280
Thank you, Guard.

713
00:38:48,760 --> 00:38:51,240
The banquet is over.
Why haven't you left?

714
00:38:55,800 --> 00:38:57,400
Your Majesty sent for me.

715
00:38:57,480 --> 00:38:59,360
When did I ever send for you?

716
00:38:59,440 --> 00:39:01,520
Since Your Majesty has nothing to say,

717
00:39:01,600 --> 00:39:02,760
I shall take my leave.

718
00:39:08,680 --> 00:39:10,840
Why did you not bow before me?

719
00:39:16,160 --> 00:39:19,680
Meng Tinghui greets Your Majesty.

720
00:39:19,760 --> 00:39:21,960
I worried

721
00:39:22,040 --> 00:39:23,840
that naming you Bureau Director

722
00:39:23,920 --> 00:39:25,000
was too great a risk.

723
00:39:25,560 --> 00:39:26,800
But now,

724
00:39:26,880 --> 00:39:28,600
I see my concern was unnecessary.

725
00:39:28,680 --> 00:39:30,400
If you truly thought it risky,

726
00:39:31,640 --> 00:39:33,560
you wouldn't have feigned drunkenness

727
00:39:33,640 --> 00:39:34,800
or gone so far

728
00:39:34,880 --> 00:39:36,520
to stage my promotion tonight.

729
00:39:36,600 --> 00:39:39,080
You worked so hard
to draw close to me

730
00:39:39,160 --> 00:39:41,160
for this position, did you not?

731
00:39:41,240 --> 00:39:42,480
I granted your wish.

732
00:39:42,560 --> 00:39:44,720
An emperor's heart is hard to read.

733
00:39:44,800 --> 00:39:46,440
Days ago, you refused me.

734
00:39:47,040 --> 00:39:49,400
Today, you defied the Left Chancellor

735
00:39:49,480 --> 00:39:50,960
then promoted me publicly.

736
00:39:51,040 --> 00:39:53,040
I cannot fathom your intentions.

737
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:55,040
That makes me uneasy.

738
00:39:57,440 --> 00:40:00,120
I gave you power beyond
either Chancellor.

739
00:40:00,200 --> 00:40:01,320
What more do you want?

740
00:40:01,400 --> 00:40:03,880
Are you after something else?

741
00:40:09,480 --> 00:40:11,880
Your favor may look like a blessing,

742
00:40:13,120 --> 00:40:16,360
but it also makes me everyone's target.

743
00:40:16,440 --> 00:40:18,360
If Your Majesty demands repayment,

744
00:40:19,480 --> 00:40:21,120
I will risk my life

745
00:40:21,840 --> 00:40:24,360
to investigate the Tiger Roar Gang.

746
00:40:25,120 --> 00:40:26,920
I ordered an investigation,

747
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:29,480
yet we still have no leads.

748
00:40:29,560 --> 00:40:30,920
How can a mere gang

749
00:40:31,000 --> 00:40:32,680
have such far-reaching power?

750
00:40:33,280 --> 00:40:34,320
You suspect

751
00:40:34,400 --> 00:40:35,480
it has court allies—

752
00:40:35,560 --> 00:40:37,240
Unproven. Don't speculate.

753
00:40:41,000 --> 00:40:43,240
Then surprise me.

754
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:47,720
I will be the blade in your hand.

755
00:40:47,800 --> 00:40:50,160
At court, friend and foe
are hard to tell apart.

756
00:40:50,240 --> 00:40:52,480
I ask to choose the Bureau's staff myself.

757
00:40:52,560 --> 00:40:53,680
In addition,

758
00:40:53,760 --> 00:40:55,160
Zhishu and Di Nian

759
00:40:55,240 --> 00:40:56,520
will assist you.

760
00:40:57,400 --> 00:41:00,120
Thank you for your great favor.

761
00:41:20,600 --> 00:41:21,440
There.

762
00:41:30,360 --> 00:41:31,200
Here it is.

763
00:41:37,200 --> 00:41:38,360
Keep digging.

764
00:41:38,840 --> 00:41:39,680
-Yes.
-Yes.

765
00:41:44,104 --> 00:41:46,104
MkvDrama.Net
